Z||000051||DISenchanted||04-10-2001||05:27 AM||||Took my father's 2000 NSX-T up to Mammoth Mountain last summer...  I stopped at Lone Pine on the way home to get some food.  When I came out there was a cop sitting next to the car.  He said that he clocked me about 30 miles back doing 183 mph.  We talked for a while and then he wrote me a ticket.  Atleast he said I was only doing 90.  Needless to say, I am no longer allowed to drive it...<P>Boy was it fun...<P>DISenchanted||||reg||4
